{"title":"Rédige un document professionnel","ts":"2026-10-11T13:20:33.544Z","msgs":[{"id":"ei1s8spde2","role":"user","text":"Rédige un document professionnel","apiText":"Rédige un document professionnel","attachments":[],"ts":"2026-10-11T13:20:33.290Z","hidden":false},{"id":"fqds2ms1je","role":"user","text":"codé une application que j'ouvre \nje configure mon token \ntout les dépôts affiche \net je clique sur un dépôt tout les fichiers affiche \nje peux chercher des fichiers \net je renomme le fichier","apiText":"codé une application que j'ouvre \nje configure mon token \ntout les dépôts affiche \net je clique sur un dépôt tout les fichiers affiche \nje peux chercher des fichiers \net je renomme le fichier","attachments":[],"ts":"2026-10-11T13:22:37.898Z","hidden":false},{"id":"l642t4s1jm","role":"bot","thinking":false,"text":"Voici l'application web complète et professionnelle pour gérer vos dépôts GitHub directement depuis une interface interactive. Elle inclut la configuration du token personnel, la liste des dépôts, l'explorateur de fichiers par dépôt, la recherche instantanée de fichiers et la fonctionnalité de renommage en utilisant directement l'API REST de GitHub.\n\n\n\nPour utiliser cette application :\n1. Enregistrez le code ci-dessus dans un fichier nommé `index.html`.\n2. Ouvrez ce fichier directement dans n'importe quel navigateur web moderne.\n3. Entrez votre *Personal Access Token* GitHub (avec les permissions `repo`) dans le champ supérieur et cliquez sur **Enregistrer**.\n4. Tous vos dépôts s'affichent automatiquement dans la barre latérale. Cliquez sur l'un d'eux pour lister ses fichiers, utilisez la barre de recherche pour filtrer instantanément, et cliquez sur **Renommer** sur n'importe quel fichier pour modifier son nom en toute simplicité.","ts":"2026-10-11T13:22:37.906Z","accumulatedThink":"","sources":[],"steps":[{"id":"step-reflect-0","name":"Réflexion","summary":"Je crée une application Web moderne et complète pour gérer ses dépôts GitHub, configurer son token, lister les fichiers, rechercher dedans e…","status":"done","details":"Je crée une application Web moderne et complète pour gérer ses dépôts GitHub, configurer son token, lister les fichiers, rechercher dedans et renommer un fichier."}],"codeBlocks":[{"lang":"html","filename":"index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Gestionnaire Pro de Dépôts GitHub</title>\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --bg-main: #0f172a;\n            --bg-card: #1e293b;\n            --bg-hover: #334155;\n            --text-main: #f8fafc;\n            --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n            --primary: #6366f1;\n            --primary-hover: #4f46e5;\n            --border: #334155;\n            --success: #22c55e;\n            --danger: #ef4444;\n        }\n\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            background-color: var(--bg-main);\n            color: var(--text-main);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: var(--bg-card);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 1.25rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .token-container {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        input, button {\n            background-color: var(--bg-main);\n            color: var(--text-main);\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n            border-radius: 0.375rem;\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            outline: none;\n            transition: border-color 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        input:focus {\n            border-color: var(--primary);\n        }\n\n        button {\n            background-color: var(--primary);\n            border-color: var(--primary);\n            font-weight: 500;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        button:hover {\n            background-color: var(--primary-hover);\n        }\n\n        button.secondary {\n            background-color: transparent;\n            border-color: var(--border);\n        }\n\n        button.secondary:hover {\n            background-color: var(--bg-hover);\n        }\n\n        main {\n            flex: 1;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 350px 1fr;\n            height: calc(100vh - 65px);\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        aside {\n            background-color: var(--bg-card);\n            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar-header {\n            padding: 1rem;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n        }\n\n        .repo-list {\n            flex: 1;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n            padding: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .repo-item {\n            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n            border-radius: 0.375rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n            transition: background-color 0.2s;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .repo-item:hover {\n            background-color: var(--bg-hover);\n        }\n\n        .repo-item.active {\n            background-color: var(--primary);\n        }\n\n        .repo-name {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .repo-desc {\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            text-overflow: ellipsis;\n        }\n\n        .repo-item.active .repo-desc {\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n        }\n\n        section.content {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            background-color: var(--bg-main);\n        }\n\n        .content-header {\n            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            background-color: var(--bg-card);\n        }\n\n        .file-explorer {\n            flex: 1;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .search-box {\n            width: 100%;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            text-align: left;\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n        }\n\n        th, td {\n            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n        }\n\n        th {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            background-color: var(--bg-card);\n        }\n\n        tr:hover td {\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\n        }\n\n        .file-row {\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        .badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 0.125rem 0.375rem;\n            border-radius: 0.25rem;\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .badge-file { background-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2); color: #818cf8; }\n        .badge-dir { background-color: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.2); color: #facc15; }\n\n        .actions {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .modal {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            z-index: 1000;\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        .modal.open {\n            display: flex;\n        }\n\n        .modal-content {\n            background-color: var(--bg-card);\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: 0.5rem;\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 450px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .modal-footer {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: flex-end;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            margin-top: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .alert {\n            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n            border-radius: 0.375rem;\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        .alert.error { background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); border: 1px solid var(--danger); color: #fca5a5; }\n        .alert.success { background-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2); border: 1px solid var(--success); color: #86efac; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <header>\n        <h1><span>📂</span> Gestionnaire GitHub Pro</h1>\n        <div class=\"token-container\">\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"tokenInput\" placeholder=\"Collez votre Personal Access Token\">\n            <button onclick=\"saveToken()\">Enregistrer</button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n        <aside>\n            <div class=\"sidebar-header\">\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"repoSearch\" placeholder=\"Filtrer les dépôts...\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"filterRepos()\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"repo-list\" id=\"repoList\">\n                <div style=\"padding: 1rem; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem;\">\n                    Configurez votre token pour afficher vos dépôts.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <section class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"content-header\">\n                <div>\n                    <h2 id=\"currentRepoTitle\">Sélectionnez un dépôt</h2>\n                    <p id=\"currentPath\" style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);\"></p>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"breadcrumb\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"file-explorer\">\n                <div id=\"alertBox\" class=\"alert\"></div>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"fileSearch\" class=\"search-box\" placeholder=\"Rechercher un fichier par nom...\" oninput=\"filterFiles()\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                \n                <div id=\"fileContainer\">\n                    <div style=\"text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 3rem;\">\n                        Choisissez un dépôt dans la liste de gauche pour explorer son contenu.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <div class=\"modal\" id=\"renameModal\">\n        <div class=\"modal-content\">\n            <h3>Renommer le fichier</h3>\n            <p id=\"renameFileInfo\" style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted);\"></p>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"newFileNameInput\" placeholder=\"Nouveau nom du fichier\">\n            <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n                <button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"closeRenameModal()\">Annuler</button>\n                <button onclick=\"confirmRename()\">Renommer</button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        let token = localStorage.getItem('github_token') || '';\n        let allRepos = [];\n        let currentRepo = null;\n        let currentFiles = [];\n        let fileToRename = null;\n        let currentPathStack = [];\n\n        if (token) {\n            document.getElementById('tokenInput').value = token;\n            fetchRepositories();\n        }\n\n        function saveToken() {\n            const val = document.getElementById('tokenInput').value.trim();\n            if (!val) {\n                showAlert('Veuillez entrer un token valide.', 'error');\n                return;\n            }\n            token = val;\n            localStorage.setItem('github_token', token);\n            showAlert('Token enregistré avec succès !', 'success');\n            fetchRepositories();\n        }\n\n        async function githubApi(endpoint) {\n            const response = await fetch(`https://api.github.com${endpoint}`, {\n                headers: {\n                    'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}`,\n                    'Accept': 'application/vnd.github+json'\n                }\n            });\n            if (!response.ok) {\n                const err = await response.json();\n                throw new Error(err.message || 'Erreur API GitHub');\n            }\n            return response.json();\n        }\n\n        async function fetchRepositories() {\n            try {\n                showAlert('Chargement des dépôts...', 'success');\n                allRepos = await githubApi('/user/repos?per_page=100&sort=updated');\n                renderRepos(allRepos);\n                hideAlert();\n            } catch (error) {\n                showAlert('Erreur lors du chargement des dépôts : ' + error.message, 'error');\n            }\n        }\n\n        function renderRepos(repos) {\n            const list = document.getElementById('repoList');\n            if (repos.length === 0) {\n                list.innerHTML = '<div style=\"padding: 1rem; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem;\">Aucun dépôt trouvé.</div>';\n                return;\n            }\n            list.innerHTML = repos.map(repo => `\n                <div class=\"repo-item ${currentRepo && currentRepo.full_name === repo.full_name ? 'active' : ''}\" onclick=\"selectRepo('${repo.full_name}')\">\n                    <div class=\"repo-name\">${repo.name}</div>\n                    <div class=\"repo-desc\">${repo.description || 'Pas de description'}</div>\n                </div>\n            `).join('');\n        }\n\n        function filterRepos() {\n            const query = document.getElementById('repoSearch').value.toLowerCase();\n            const filtered = allRepos.filter(r => r.name.toLowerCase().includes(query) || (r.description && r.description.toLowerCase().includes(query)));\n            renderRepos(filtered);\n        }\n\n        async function selectRepo(fullName) {\n            currentRepo = allRepos.find(r => r.full_name === fullName);\n            renderRepos(allRepos);\n            document.getElementById('currentRepoTitle').innerText = currentRepo.name;\n            currentPathStack = [];\n            await loadPathContents('');\n        }\n\n        async function loadPathContents(path) {\n            try {\n                showAlert('Chargement des fichiers...', 'success');\n                const contents = await githubApi(`/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${path}`);\n                currentFiles = Array.isArray(contents) ? contents : [contents];\n                \n                document.getElementById('currentPath').innerText = `/${path}`;\n                document.getElementById('fileSearch').style.display = 'block';\n                renderFiles(currentFiles);\n                hideAlert();\n            } catch (error) {\n                showAlert('Erreur lors du chargement du contenu : ' + error.message, 'error');\n            }\n        }\n\n        function renderFiles(files) {\n            const container = document.getElementById('fileContainer');\n            if (files.length === 0) {\n                container.innerHTML = '<div style=\"text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2rem;\">Ce dossier est vide.</div>';\n                return;\n            }\n\n            container.innerHTML = `\n                <table>\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>Nom</th>\n                            <th>Type</th>\n                            <th>Taille</th>\n                            <th style=\"text-align: right;\">Actions</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        ${files.map(file => `\n                            <tr class=\"file-row\">\n                                <td onclick=\"handleRowClick('${file.type}', '${file.path}', '${file.name}')\">\n                                    <strong>${file.name}</strong>\n                                </td>\n                                <td onclick=\"handleRowClick('${file.type}', '${file.path}', '${file.name}')\">\n                                    <span class=\"badge ${file.type === 'dir' ? 'badge-dir' : 'badge-file'}\">${file.type}</span>\n                                </td>\n                                <td onclick=\"handleRowClick('${file.type}', '${file.path}', '${file.name}')\">\n                                    ${file.size ? formatSize(file.size) : '-'}\n                                </td>\n                                <td style=\"text-align: right;\">\n                                    <div class=\"actions\" style=\"justify-content: flex-end;\">\n                                        ${file.type === 'file' ? `<button class=\"secondary\" style=\"padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem;\" onclick=\"openRenameModal('${file.path}', '${file.name}', '${file.sha}')\">Renommer</button>` : ''}\n                                        <button class=\"secondary\" style=\"padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem;\" onclick=\"window.open('${file.html_url}', '_blank')\">Voir sur GitHub</button>\n                                    </div>\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                        `).join('')}\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            `;\n        }\n\n        function handleRowClick(type, path, name) {\n            if (type === 'dir') {\n                currentPathStack.push(path);\n                loadPathContents(path);\n            }\n        }\n\n        function filterFiles() {\n            const query = document.getElementById('fileSearch').value.toLowerCase();\n            const filtered = currentFiles.filter(f => f.name.toLowerCase().includes(query));\n            renderFiles(filtered);\n        }\n\n        function formatSize(bytes) {\n            if (bytes === 0) return '0 Octets';\n            const k = 1024;\n            const sizes = ['Octets', 'Ko', 'Mo', 'Go'];\n            const i = Math.floor(Math.log(bytes) / Math.log(k));\n            return parseFloat((bytes / Math.pow(k, i)).toFixed(2)) + ' ' + sizes[i];\n        }\n\n        function openRenameModal(path, name, sha) {\n            fileToRename = { path, name, sha };\n            document.getElementById('renameFileInfo').innerText = `Chemin actuel : ${path}`;\n            document.getElementById('newFileNameInput').value = name;\n            document.getElementById('renameModal').classList.add('open');\n        }\n\n        function closeRenameModal() {\n            document.getElementById('renameModal').classList.remove('open');\n            fileToRename = null;\n        }\n\n        async function confirmRename() {\n            const newName = document.getElementById('newFileNameInput').value.trim();\n            if (!newName || newName === fileToRename.name) {\n                closeRenameModal();\n                return;\n            }\n\n            const pathParts = fileToRename.path.split('/');\n            pathParts.pop();\n            const newPath = pathParts.length > 0 ? pathParts.join('/') + '/' + newName : newName;\n\n            try {\n                showAlert('Renommage en cours...', 'success');\n                \n                // 1. Récupérer le contenu actuel du fichier\n                const fileData = await githubApi(`/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${fileToRename.path}`);\n                \n                // 2. Créer le fichier avec le nouveau nom\n                const createRes = await fetch(`https://api.github.com/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${newPath}`, {\n                    method: 'PUT',\n                    headers: {\n                        'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}`,\n                        'Accept': 'application/vnd.github+json',\n                        'Content-Type': 'application/json'\n                    },\n                    body: JSON.stringify({\n                        message: `Renommer ${fileToRename.name} en ${newName}`,\n                        content: fileData.content\n                    })\n                });\n\n                if (!createRes.ok) throw new Error('Erreur lors de la création du fichier renommé');\n\n                // 3. Supprimer l'ancien fichier\n                const deleteRes = await fetch(`https://api.github.com/repos/${currentRepo.full_name}/contents/${fileToRename.path}`, {\n                    method: 'DELETE',\n                    headers: {\n                        'Authorization': `Bearer et ${token}`, // Correction syntaxe Auth header en dessous\n                        'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}`,\n                        'Accept': 'application/vnd.github+json',\n                        'Content-Type': 'application/json'\n                    },\n                    body: JSON.stringify({\n                        message: `Suppression de l'ancien fichier ${fileToRename.name}`,\n                        sha: fileToRename.sha\n                    })\n                });\n\n                if (!deleteRes.ok) throw new Error('Erreur lors de la suppression de l\\'ancien fichier');\n\n                closeRenameModal();\n                showAlert('Fichier renommé avec succès !', 'success');\n                \n                // Recharger le dossier courant\n                const currentFolder = pathParts.join('/');\n                loadPathContents(currentFolder);\n\n            } catch (error) {\n                showAlert('Erreur lors du renommage : ' + error.message, 'error');\n                closeRenameModal();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function showAlert(message, type) {\n            const box = document.getElementById('alertBox');\n            box.className = `alert ${type}`;\n            box.innerText = message;\n            box.style.display = 'block';\n        }\n\n        function hideAlert() {\n            document.getElementById('alertBox').style.display = 'none';\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>"}],"typing":false,"apiHidden":true},{"id":"ciu3h6t79w","role":"user","text":"mobile plus professionnel \nplus stylé plus propre","apiText":"mobile plus professionnel \nplus stylé plus propre","attachments":[],"ts":"2026-10-11T13:23:31.988Z","hidden":false}]}